Bootstrap: docker
From: ubuntu:26.04


%post
    apt-get update && apt-get install -y wget
    
    wget -O /usr/local/bin/chopper https://github.com/wdecoster/chopper/releases/download/v0.13.0/chopper-linux
    chmod +x /usr/local/bin/chopper


%runscript
    exec chopper "$@"


%help
    Singularity container of chopper v0.13.0: 
    Rust implementation of NanoFilt+NanoLyse, both originally written in Python
    This tool, intended for long read sequencing such as PacBio or ONT, filters and trims a fastq file
    https://github.com/wdecoster/chopper


%labels
    Version chopper v0.13.0
    Author Audrey Lapendry
    Date 2026-08-01